// The hook fires: full Core calls neither `Builtin.rewrite__impl` nor
// `Builtin.replace`, and each function returns the box it was given: its
// body ends in a bare variable. The erased indices are no parameters, and a
// Box, one constructor of one runtime field, is that field's value: each
// function has one parameter.
// CHECK-NOT: Builtin.{{replace|rewrite__impl}}
// CHECK: {{^}}Main.commuted (w {{[^()]*}}) :
// CHECK: {{^ *#[0-9]+ *$}}
// CHECK-NOT: Builtin.{{replace|rewrite__impl}}
// CHECK: {{^}}Main.padded (w {{[^()]*}}) :
// CHECK: {{^ *#[0-9]+ *$}}
// CHECK-NOT: Builtin.{{replace|rewrite__impl}}
